    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A jarring melody fills a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, it loses Concentration and has Disadvantage on Constitution saving throws made to maintain Concentration for the spell’s duration.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yEmz6e8YKa25I0xe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>End the Concentration of the creatures that fail by hand; the effect gives them the Disadvantage.</p></section>",
